WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.208 --> 00:00:12.125
Hi.

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:15.208
Hi.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.500
What are you playing?

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:20.875
Ah, the school song.

00:00:26.542 --> 00:00:28.375
But you're playing
the soprano line.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.667
Shouldn't you be
playing the melody?

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.958
-You're a tenor, right?
-Yeah.

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.083
Simon.

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.917
Simon, don't you know
how to read sheet music?

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.750
No, but I'm trying to learn.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:47.458
But you played
so well before.

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.250
I can only play by ear, but…

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:52.458
you can show me.

00:00:52.542 --> 00:00:53.667
You play.

00:01:00.458 --> 00:01:02.292
-Sorry.
-No worries.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.833
OK, show me.
Now you know how it goes.

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:25.667
Yeah.

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:32.167
No, no, no. Listen.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.875
Start with these.
Those three.

00:01:43.292 --> 00:01:44.667
Yeah! Great!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.667
Hey…

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.875
about what happened
on Friday…

00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:01.375
I was…

00:02:07.458 --> 00:02:08.583
I just wanted
to say that I--

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:11.042
I think that maybe
we should forget about that.

00:02:16.542 --> 00:02:19.208
Because I said that I, like…

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:23.833
-That I'm not like that.
-Right.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.542
You know what I'm saying?

00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:29.458
-Yes, I understand. I--
-You sure?

00:02:29.542 --> 00:02:32.375
-Hey, time's up.
-Hi. I have to go.

00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.000
But I still want us
to be friends.

00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:36.167
Yeah.

00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:41.417
My class starts soon
so I have to go.

